      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.22,
          "en": "Now, what we're doing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 5.61,
          "en": "in add place to user places is in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.61,
          "end": 9.51,
          "en": "something you could call optimistic updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.51,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "Because in the end, I'm updating my user places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 15.9,
          "en": "before this put request here was sent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.9,
          "end": 19.233,
          "en": "and before I even know whether it worked or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.61,
          "end": 25.61,
          "en": "And as a consequence, if we go to the backend code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 29.7,
          "en": "and there to the put route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.7,
          "end": 34.05,
          "en": "if I were to return an error here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 37.35,
          "en": "to simulate that something goes wrong on this backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.35,
          "end": 40.293,
          "en": "If I were to do that here on the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.21,
          "end": 45,
          "en": "and you then would restart that backend server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45,
          "end": 46.353,
          "en": "if you would do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.55,
          "end": 50.94,
          "en": "you would have a bug in your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.94,
          "end": 55.94,
          "en": "Because now if I reload, you'll see that if I add a place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 56.37,
          "end": 61.37,
          "en": "let's say the Taj Mahal, it shows up instantly here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 61.62,
          "end": 64.95,
          "en": "But if I reload, it's gone because it never was added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 67.293,
          "en": "to the backend because we got an error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 68.78999999999999,
          "end": 70.98,
          "en": "By the way, that's not the only bug we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.98,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "If I add a place that we had already added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 77.973,
          "en": "it's added twice now until I reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 83.03999999999999,
          "en": "And now, it did not just fail because I added this error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 86.34,
          "en": "to the backend, but because I have some code in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 86.34,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "in general, that would've executed either way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 91.44,
          "en": "that would've prevented the same place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.44,
          "end": 93.333,
          "en": "from being added twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.97999999999999,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "So these are some bugs which occur now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 102.57,
          "en": "because I'm performing this optimistic updating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 102.57,
          "end": 107.10300000000001,
          "en": "where I am updating my places before I have a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 108.06,
          "end": 110.85,
          "en": "Because if I would wait for the response,",
